### Crear empresa
POST http://localhost:4000/api/empresas HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nit": "900123456-1",
  "razon_social": "TransMovil S.A.S",
  "contacto_principal": "Juan Perez",
  "status": "active"
}

