### Crear empresa con NIT duplicado (409)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/empresas HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nit": "900123456-1",
  "razon_social": "Otra Empresa Ltda",
  "status": "active"
}
